  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "[VRChat 2026.3.2 (OPEN BETA)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202632-open-beta) - August 18 - `Build 1896`:\n\n> Removed redundant “Close” button from “Options”.\n\nPlease don't remove this. Sometimes the Action Menu can bug out where pressing the Action Menu key (R on desktop) does not close the Action Menu, and in this event the only way to escape the Action Menu and fix the issue is to navigate and press the \"Close\" button from Action Menu \"Options\".\n\nIt's a rare bug (no known steps to reproduce), but it's very annoying when it happens and having this failsafe \"Close\" button would avoid needing a client restart or rejoin.",
